<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-04-27T00:00:00.000Z" agent="Claude" version="22.0.0" type="device">
  <diagram id="http-client" name="HTTP Client and Strategy">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="700" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="HTTP Client and Request Strategy" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="250" y="20" width="500" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="http_main" value="HttpClient (Thread-Safe)" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;fillColor=#dae8fc;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;fontSize=14" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="260" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="http_main_con" value="GET Flow:

1. Acquire rate-limit token (domain)
2. Pick current UA for domain
3. Build browser-like headers
4. Send via tenacity retry policy
5. On 403:
   - wait with jitter
   - rotate UA
   - retry (max 2 rotations)
6. Return 2xx or raise exception

Config:
  max_403_rotations=2
  rotation_delay_base=3.0s" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="http_main">
          <mxGeometry y="40" width="260" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rate_limiter" value="DomainRateLimiter" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;fillColor=#fff2cc;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;fontSize=14" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="340" y="80" width="220" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rl_con" value="Per-domain rate limiting

* connection(domain) context manager
* Uses semaphore per domain
* Blocks until token available
* Thread-safe via threading.Lock

Default: 1 request per domain at a time" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="rate_limiter">
          <mxGeometry y="40" width="220" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ua_pool" value="UserAgentPool" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;fillColor=#d5e8d4;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;fontSize=14" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="340" y="230" width="220" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ua_con" value="UA Rotation Strategy

* Pool of browser User-Agents
* get(domain) -> current UA
* rotate(domain) -> next UA

get_browser_headers(ua) ->
  sec-ch-ua, Sec-Fetch-*, etc." style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="ua_pool">
          <mxGeometry y="40" width="220" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="retry" value="Retry Policy (Tenacity)" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;fillColor=#f8cecc;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;fontSize=14" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="600" y="80" width="220" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="retry_con" value="Retry Matrix:

429 Retry-After:
  respect header | else 30-60-120-240s
  max 4 attempts

502/503/504:
  exponential + jitter 5-10-20-40s
  max 3 attempts

500:
  exponential + jitter
  max 3 attempts

403: NOT retried (UA rotation)
404/410: NOT retried

Timeout: 2s fixed, max 3
ConnectionError: exponential + jitter" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=9" vertex="1" parent="retry">
          <mxGeometry y="40" width="220" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="proxy" value="Proxy Support" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;fillColor=#e1d5e7;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;fontSize=14" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="600" y="300" width="220" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="proxy_con" value="* get_proxies() from ENV
  HTTP_PROXY, HTTPS_PROXY
* proxy_enabled flag in HttpClient
* On ProxyError: disable and retry
* On 407: disable proxy and retry

ArxivClient:
  Direct requests (no proxy)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="proxy">
          <mxGeometry y="40" width="220" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="env_box" value="Environment Variables" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;fillColor=#f5f5f5;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;fontSize=12" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="360" width="260" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="env_con" value="* HTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY
  Proxy configuration

* User-Agent strings (pool)
  Browser UA rotation pool

* GRAFANA_OTLP_*
  For observability backends" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="env_box">
          <mxGeometry y="30" width="260" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
